  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion and Dissemination of Sustainable Food Systems through FAO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">i) to contribute to the promotion of sustainable agriculture, forestry, and fisheries and the revitalization and development of rural areas by collecting and analysing good practices in GIAHS sites disseminating and raising awareness of these results, and ii) to achieve increase in the new GIAHS sites, smooth implementation of action plans, promotion of sustainable agriculture, forestry, and fisheries, food security and poverty eradication in the world by reflecting the outcomes  obtained through the collection and analysis of good practices in GIAHS sites.</narrative>
  </description>
